#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "B<stime> sets the system's idea of the time and date.  Time, pointed to "
#| "by I<t>, is measured in seconds from 00:00:00 GMT January 1, 1970.  "
#| "B<stime()> may only be executed by the super user."
msgid ""
"B<stime>()  sets the system's idea of the time and date.  The time, pointed "
"to by I<t>, is measured in seconds since the Epoch, 1970-01-01 00:00:00 "
"+0000 (UTC).  B<stime>()  may be executed only by the superuser."
msgstr ""
"B<stime>은 시스템 개념(idea)의 시간과 날짜를 설정한다.  I<t>가 지정하는 시간"
"은 00:00:00 GMT January 1, 1970 이후의 초로 계산된다.  B<stime()>은 단지 슈"
"퍼 사용자(root)만이 사용할수 있다."

